### Broker HTTP API 测试文件
### 使用方法：
### 1. 安装 VS Code REST Client 扩展
### 2. 修改下面的变量值
### 3. 点击请求上方的 "Send Request" 链接发送请求

### ============================================
### 配置变量
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://192.168.116.217:8081
@apiToken = 22182666
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================
### 认证头（自动使用上面的变量）
### ============================================

# Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

### ============================================
### 1. 获取 Broker 统计信息
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

###

### ============================================
### 2. 获取已连接客户端列表
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

###

### ============================================
### 3. 获取特定主题的订阅者信息
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/test/topic
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

###

### ============================================
### 4. 获取 Broker 配置参数
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

###

### ============================================
### 5. 发布消息到主题 (QoS 0)
### ============================================
### 注意：topic 在 URL 路径中，qos 和 retain 作为查询参数
### body 部分是实际的消息内容

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/publish/test/topic?qos=0&retain=false
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from REST Client!

###

### ============================================
### 6. 发布消息到主题 (QoS 1)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/publish/test/topic?qos=1&retain=false
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a QoS 1 message

###

### ============================================
### 7. 发布保留消息
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/publish/retained/topic?qos=0&retain=true
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

This message will be retained

###

### ============================================
### 8. 发布 JSON 格式消息
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/publish/sensor/data?qos=1&retain=false
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 25.5,
  "humidity": 60,
  "timestamp": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### ============================================
### 8.1 发布二进制负载（使用 base64 编码）
### ============================================
### 注意：body 以 "base64:" 开头，后面是 base64 编码的二进制数据
### 示例：base64 编码的字节序列 0x00 0x01 0x02 0xFF 0xFE 0xFD

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/publish/binary/test?qos=0&retain=false
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

base64:AAEC//79

###

### ============================================
### 8.2 发布更大的二进制数据（图片/文件片段）
### ============================================
### base64 编码的 32 字节测试数据

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/publish/binary/test?qos=1&retain=false
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

base64:QUJDREVGR0hJSktMTU5PUFFSU1RVVldYWVoxMjM0NTY3ODk=

###

### ============================================
### 9. 踢掉指定客户端（通过 Client ID）
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kick/mqttx_9eeed6b0
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

###

### ============================================
### 10. 踢掉指定客户端（通过 IP 地址）
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kick/192.168.116.218
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

###

### ============================================
### 11. 重置 Broker 统计信息
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reset
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}

###

### ============================================
### 12. 批量更新配置项（使用URL-encoded格式）
### ============================================

### 更新单个配置：日志级别
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

log_level=3

###

### 更新单个配置：启用统计
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

enable_stats=true

###

### 批量更新多个配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

log_level=2&stats_interval=30&timeout_ms=5000

###

### 批量更新缓冲区大小和客户端限制
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

rx_buf_sz=4096&tx_buf_sz=4096&max_clients=50

###

### 更新所有常用配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

log_level=1&stats_interval=60&enable_stats=true&timeout_ms=10000&max_clients=100

###

### 测试无效配置项（应该返回错误）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

invalid_option=123

###

### 测试混合有效和无效配置（部分成功）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

log_level=2&invalid_option=456&stats_interval=45

###

### 测试超出范围的值
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

log_level=99&max_clients=9999

###

### ============================================
### 13. 完整配置项测试
### ============================================

### 更新所有功能开关
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

enable_stats=true&enable_api=true

###

### 更新网络端口配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

port=1883&api_port=8081

###

### 更新缓冲区大小和超时
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

rx_buf_sz=8192&tx_buf_sz=8192&timeout_ms=5000

###

### 更新容量限制（设置为0表示无限制）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

max_clients=0&max_subs=0&max_retained=0&max_pending_wills=0

###

### 更新负载限制
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

max_payload_len=8192&max_will_payload_len=512

###

### 更新会话持久化配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

default_session_expiry_interval=3600

###

### 更新API认证token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

api_token=newtoken123456789

###

### 测试TLS配置（如果启用TLS）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

use_tls=false&port_tls=8883&tls_version=0

###

### 测试WebSocket配置（如果启用WebSocket）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

use_ws=true&port_ws=8080

###

### 测试MQTT 5特性（如果启用V5）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

max_packet_size=268435455&topic_alias_max=10

###

### 测试认证配置（如果启用认证）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Authorization: Basic {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=secret123

###

